{"assertion":{"kind":"theoretical","text":"Erdős Problem #714: declared status 'open'. Formalized: no. Is it true that\\[\\mathrm{ex}(n; K_{r,r}) \\gg n^{2-1/r}?\\] Current best: K\\\"{o}v\\'{a}ri, S\\'{o}s, and Tur\\'{a}n \\cite{KST54} proved\\[\\mathrm{ex}(n; K_{r,r}) \\ll n^{2-1/r}\\]for all $r\\geq 2$. Brown \\cite{Br66} and, independently, Erd\\H{o}s, R\\'{e}nyi, and S\\'{o}s \\cite{ERS66}, proved the conjectured lower bound when $r=3$. When $r=2$ it is known that\\[\\mathrm{ex}(n;K_{2,2})=\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+o(1)\\right)n^{3/2}\\](see [768], since $K_{2,2}=C_4$). Prize: no. Tags: graph theory, turan number."},"claim_id":"vcl_e2d70c1d52ef78b066d323f7fa7e70b93745081cc3fe57d106dbf277b4fd3b26","conditions":[],"created_at":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","evidence":[],"extensions":{"vela.legacy-finding.v1":{"annotations":[],"attachments":[],"confidence":{"basis":"external catalogue record","extraction_confidence":1.0,"kind":"frontier_epistemic","method":"llm_initial","score":0.5},"flags":{"contested":false,"declining":false,"gap":false,"gravity_well":false,"negative_space":false,"retracted":false},"legacy_conditions":{"duration":null,"text":""},"legacy_evidence":{"evidence_spans":[],"method":"erdos_deep","model_system":"n/a","replicated":false,"replication_count":null,"type":"theoretical"},"legacy_links":[],"legacy_provenance":{"authors":[],"doi":null,"extraction":{"extracted_at":"","extractor_version":"","method":"database_import","model":null,"model_version":null},"review":null,"source_type":"database_record","title":"erdos_deep:714","year":null},"previous_version":null,"source_schema":"https://vela.science/schema/finding-bundle/v0.10.0","source_version":1,"updated":null}},"imported_from":{"era":"finding_v0_10","object_id":"vf_4afee1f8e11852cb","object_root":"sha256:d8f12f66d7b2b4a4d58f5a2ad85bd2c434d96863eafe206842f8227787253e32","predecessor_commit":"c236b4fdedb25e0d726e24e2780d50962e4844f7"},"provenance":[{"kind":"database_record","title":"erdos_deep:714"}],"relations"